      	<span id="d.en.169110"></span>
    <div class="rep-profile" data-region="CT,DE,IN,ME,MA,MD,NH,NJ,NY,OH,PA,RI,VT,VA,DC,WV">
            <img src="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/SiteManager?ctfn=download&amp;fnno=60&amp;ceid=bcdaad9d641d124c70dcd1cd77e7c9e514e8cd4d" alt="james-kim" style="    ">
            <div class="rep-profile__top">
                <h2>James Kim</h2>
                <h3>Admissions Counselor</h3>
                <a href="mailto:james.kim@wheaton.edu">james.kim@wheaton.edu</a>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Counselor for: <br>Connecticut, Delaware, Indiana, Maine, </strong><strong>Maryland, Massachusetts</strong><strong>, New Hampshire, New Jersey, New York, Ohio, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, Vermont, Virginia, Washington DC, West Virginia,&nbsp;</strong></p>
    <p>Hi! I am James and I'm passionate about helping you through the admissions process.&nbsp;</p>
    <p><a data-t4-type="sslink" href="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/preview/1/en/122937" data-t4-ss-link-id="15">Find out more about James</a> or <a href="https://calendly.com/james-kim-3">make an appointment to speak with James</a></p>
            </div><span id="d.en.169108"></span>
    <div class="rep-profile" data-region="AL, AR, FL, GA, KY, LA, MS, MO, NC, SC, TN
    ">
            <img src="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/SiteManager?ctfn=download&amp;fnno=60&amp;ceid=cfe75607079809c4934c6cf965118b985866ad0a" alt="Hannah Nokes 2021" style="    ">
            <div class="rep-profile__top">
                <h2>Hannah Hooker</h2>
                <h3>Admissions Counselor</h3>
                <a href="mailto:hannah.hooker@wheaton.edu">hannah.hooker@wheaton.edu</a>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Counselor for: </strong></p>
    <ul>
    <li><strong>Alabama, Arkansas, Florida, Georgia, Kentucky, Louisiana, Mississippi, Missouri, North Carolina, South Carolina, Tennessee, and Vanguard</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Illinois Zip Codes: 61200-62999&nbsp;</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Welcome! As a 2019 Wheaton College graduate, I'm so excited you're looking into Wheaton! During my time here studying Christian Formation and Ministry and Spanish, I was challenged by professors and peers to think critically about my faith, grow as a Christ-follower, and serve well in all areas of my life--both in the working world and in the relationships and little everyday moments outside of it.&nbsp;</p>
    <p><a data-t4-type="sslink" href="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/preview/1/en/113082" data-t4-ss-link-id="15">Find out more about Hannah</a>, or <a href="https://calendly.com/hannahhooker">make an online appointment with Hannah</a>.</p>
            </div><span id="d.en.189996"></span>
    <div class="rep-profile" data-region="CO, MI, MN, WI
    ">
            <img src="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/SiteManager?ctfn=download&amp;fnno=60&amp;ceid=08a70db7e2e8200b5d6971bbc01c7eae6866694f" alt="Colin Swanson" style="    ">
            <div class="rep-profile__top">
                <h2>Colin Swanson</h2>
                <h3>Admissions Counselor</h3>
                <a href="mailto:colin.swanson@wheaton.edu">colin.swanson@wheaton.edu</a>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Counselor for:</strong></p>
    <ul>
    <li><strong>Colorado, Michigan, Minnesota, Wisconsin</strong></li>
    <li><strong>In Illinois:&nbsp; Zip Codes 60900-61199, Timothy Christian School</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Welcome! As a 2022 Wheaton College graduate, I am overjoyed to know that you are considering Wheaton College as a place on your college exploration journey. I truly cannot be more thankful that the Lord guided me to attend this wonderful college where I was able to grow both spiritually and academically around some of the most amazing people I have met. The Christian Liberal Arts education that Wheaton offers challenged me in my ability to think critically about my faith and how integrated it is in all the areas of study that Wheaton offers.</p>
    <p><a data-t4-type="sslink" href="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/preview/1/en/110221" data-t4-ss-link-id="17">Read more about Colin</a> or <a href="https://calendly.com/colinswanson">make an appointment to speak with Colin.</a></p>
            </div><span id="d.en.249132"></span>
    <div class="rep-profile" data-region="">
            <img src="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/SiteManager?ctfn=download&amp;fnno=60&amp;ceid=77b5ebc0cccb94f512b5c2aedee4a3e4d4385a07" alt="Ada Yuan Headshot" style="    ">
            <div class="rep-profile__top">
                <h2>Ada Yuan</h2>
                <h3>Admissions Counselor</h3>
                <a href="mailto:ada.yuan@wheaton.edu">ada.yuan@wheaton.edu</a>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Counselor for:<br>International Students</strong></p>
    <p>I was born and raised in China until I was 15 years old. I first came to the U.S. as an international student for high school in Michigan in 2014 and then graduated from Wheaton College in 2022 with my undergraduate degrees in Economics and Communication.</p>
    <p>All of my experiences at Wheaton have made me into the person I am today, and I would not trade that for anything. It’s an absolute honor for me to serve you throughout your admissions process at Wheaton, and I can’t wait to hear your stories. Looking forward to connecting with you!</p>
    <p><a data-t4-type="sslink" href="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/preview/1/en/102463" data-t4-ss-link-id="6">Find out more about Ada's story</a> or <a href="https://calendly.com/ada-yuan">make an appointment to speak with Ada</a>.</p>
            </div><span id="d.en.189997"></span>
    <div class="rep-profile" data-region="AZ, TX">
            <img src="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/SiteManager?ctfn=download&amp;fnno=60&amp;ceid=7435974b6e1772eca27621068cece687dc06c387" alt="jamie-desai-2023" style="    ">
            <div class="rep-profile__top">
                <h2>Jamie Desai

    </h2>
                <h3>Admissions Counselor</h3>
                <a href="mailto:jamie.desai@wheaton.edu">jamie.desai@wheaton.edu</a>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Counselor for:</strong></p>
    <ul>
    <li><strong>Arizona, Texas, Transfers</strong></li>
    <li><strong>For Illinois: Zip Codes 60500-60599&nbsp;</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Hi! My name is Jamie Desai, and I am honored to walk alongside you as you discern next steps for your future.</p>
    <p><a data-t4-type="sslink" href="https://cms.wheaton.edu/terminalfour/preview/1/en/110222" data-t4-ss-link-id="13">Read more about my story</a> or&nbsp;<a title="set up an appointment with Jamie Desai" href="https://calendly.com/jamie-desai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">set up an appointment with me here</a>.</p>
