            <p><strong>Counselor for:</strong></p>
    <ul>
    <li><strong>Alaska, California, Hawaii, Idaho, Iowa, Kansas, Montana, Nebraska, Nevada, New Mexico, North Dakota, Oklahoma, Oregon, South Dakota, Utah, Washington, Wyoming</strong></li>
    <li><strong>In Illinois: Wheaton North High School</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Hello and Welcome! I am so excited that you are interested in Wheaton College. I can’t wait to help you explore everything Wheaton has to offer.</p>
